stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> validating: 发起安装(选定 skill+目标)
  [*] --> confirming: 发起卸载(项目级副本)
  validating --> copying: target_ok
  validating --> conflict_blocked: conflict_found(同名阻止)
  validating --> cancelled: target_stale(失效项目)
  copying --> installed: copy_ok
  copying --> failed_cleaned: copy_fail(清理半成品)
  confirming --> deleting: confirm
  confirming --> cancelled: cancel
  deleting --> uninstalled: delete_done
  installed --> [*]
  conflict_blocked --> [*]
  failed_cleaned --> [*]
  uninstalled --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of copying
    解引用深拷贝,落地必为真文件
    失败即清理,不留残缺目录
  end note
  note right of confirming
    确认弹窗显示完整删除路径
    全局层 skill 无卸载入口(库只读)
  end note
